say | | [Kusakam] I'm back. The armor is still here, at the edge of the canyon.
say | | [Kusakam] Time to meditate. Maybe it will reveal its secret to me.
say | | [Kusakam] I sit down by the sacred armor. Silence wraps around me.
say | | [Kusakam] Spirits of the desert... They're here, I can feel them.
say | | [Kusakam] Maybe it's through them that I can become a shaman.
say | | [Kusakam] I close my eyes and listen... To the silence of the canyon.
say | | [Kusakam] The armor... It reminds me of something important.
say | | [Kusakam] Time to take it. It has to be with me.
exit|
